{"id":"n3-122","title":"～わけだ (〜wake da)","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Expresses a logical conclusion or reason based on information; 'that's why', 'no wonder', 'it means'.","longExplanation":"The ～わけだ grammar point is used to express a conclusion, reason, or interpretation based on a certain situation or piece of information. It can be translated as 'that's why', 'no wonder', or 'it means'.","formation":"Verb-casual + わけだ, い-Adjective + わけだ, な-Adjective + なわけだ, Noun + のわけだ","examples":[{"jp":"彼は風邪を引いている。だから、声がかすれているわけだ。","romaji":"Kare wa kaze wo hiite iru. Dakara, koe ga kasurete iru wake da.","en":"He has a cold. That's why his voice is hoarse.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"風邪","vocabId":"1583720","reading":"かぜ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"引い","vocabId":"1169250","reading":"ひく","baseForm":"引く"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だから","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"声","vocabId":"1380440","reading":"こえ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"かすれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"かすれる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"わけ","vocabId":"1538330","reading":"わけ"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[15,16]},{"jp":"今日は忙しかった。だから、疲れたわけだ。","romaji":"Kyou wa isogashikatta. Dakara, tsukareta wake da.","en":"Today was busy. No wonder I'm tired.","words":[{"surface":"今日","vocabId":"1579110","reading":"きょう"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"忙しかっ","vocabId":"1519290","reading":"いそがしい","baseForm":"忙しい"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だから","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"疲れ","vocabId":"1483730","reading":"つかれ","baseForm":"疲れる"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"わけ","vocabId":"1538330","reading":"わけ"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[9,10]},{"jp":"田中さんはたくさん勉強している。だから、試験に合格したわけだ。","romaji":"Tanaka-san wa takusan benkyou shite iru. Dakara, shiken ni goukaku shita wake da.","en":"Tanaka has been studying a lot. It means he passed the exam.","words":[{"surface":"田中","vocabId":null},{"surface":"さん","vocabId":"1579350","reading":"さん"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"たくさん","vocabId":"1415870","reading":"たくさん"},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だから","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"合格","vocabId":"1284600","reading":"ごうかく"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"わけ","vocabId":"1538330","reading":"わけ"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[16,17]},{"jp":"彼女は有名な歌手の娘なんだ。だから、歌が上手なわけだ。","romaji":"Kanojo wa yuumei na kashu no musume nan da. Dakara, uta ga jouzu na wake da.","en":"She's the daughter of a famous singer. That's why she's good at singing.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"有名","vocabId":"1541620","reading":"ゆうめい"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"歌手","vocabId":"1193290","reading":"かしゅ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"娘","vocabId":"1531190","reading":"むすめ"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だから","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"歌","vocabId":"1193180","reading":"うた"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surfa